  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Sam is in May's bedroom. May has a pet. \"Is it a dog?\" asks Sam. \"No, it isn't.\" \"Is it a bird?\" \"No, it isn't.\" \"It is on the bookcase.\"",
      "Sam looks. He sees a toy snake. \"Is it a snake?\" \"No, it isn't.\" \"It is next to the snake.\" \"It is white.\" \"Is it a sheep?\" \"Yes, it is!\"",
      "\"Her name is Sue.\" \"I love my sheep,\" says May. \"Do you have a pet?\" \"Yes, I do,\" says Sam. \"I have a dog.\" Sam smiles. May smiles too. \"What a nice room!\""
    ],
